# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Windows checkouts were producing CRLF, which silently broke a test that
# matched an exact string in config.js, and produced "LF will be replaced by
# CRLF" noise on every commit. Git stores LF either way; this makes the working
# tree match.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pptx binary
